1
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,960
We've got movement on sector seven.

2
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,570
What time is it?

3
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:47,970
Tug control, we have visual contact with
the target, initiating docking approach now.

4
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:53,010
Copy that, manoeuvring thrusters
engaged, monitoring rotation rate.

5
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:08,720
We cannot bring it down.
Nine tonnes. Not even close.

6
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,380
There we go, come on now.

7
00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:45,520
Rafael, this is mission control calling.

8
00:01:49,010 --> 00:01:51,600
Look, Dad. A shooting star.
